Mutation
- [N1] Node-level mutation: element=action(n4,"end - nok"); source=i5:If the availability is "nok", then the process of booking the bus will end.; reason=The action element models the process ending but improperly appends the condition '- nok' to its content, distorting the original text with an invented qualifier.
- [N2] Node-level mutation: element=action(n6,"end - ok"); source=i6:if the availability is "ok", you can proceed to book the bus and the process will come to an end.; reason=The action element models the process ending but improperly appends the condition '- ok' to its content, distorting the original text with an invented qualifier.
